summary:
  The deadline measures from the moment it is asked, so it never fires.

history:
  Measured on 2026-09-27. main.qml clears the quiet stamp every time audio
  buffers, so a station playing normally carries none, and _replayOrder then
  stamped Date.now() — nothing is older than the instant it is asked about.
  Radio on at eleven, lid closed, network back at eight: the guard added for
  exactly that report waved it through and the station played nine hours late.

target:
  package/contents/ui/RetryLogic.js

find:
      if (heardAt > 0) return heardAt;

replace:
      if (false) return heardAt;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_retrylogic.qml::test_a_night_asleep_ends_the_order_the_morning_after.
  Line-neutral.
